# Per request (main-thread ms, sampled): GET /api/raid 3.8 ms (A, list grows 40 -> 3.7k rows) / 10.2 ms (B, ~5.3k-5.8k rows);
#                                        POST /api/raid 5.1 ms (A) / 13.3 ms (B).
# GET /api/integration-tasks, GET /api/employees, GET /healthz together are < 2 % of the loop in both windows.

# Inside res.send(<1.7-3 MB string>) of GET /api/raid (profile A, caller chains):
